  "researchNotes": "Official shop (teatrofragranzeuniche.it, Magento, not Shopify; pages show FIRENZE) was read through the Perfumes category pages: Luxury Perfume (11 listings) and Luxury Cologne (8 listings). 17 personal fragrances kept (10 perfumes, 7 luxury colognes), all 100 ml sprays with an Olfactory Pyramid (head/heart/base) on each product page. Excluded: the two Discovery Kit listings, and all home fragrances, diffusers, sticks, sprays, candles, fabric and car lines. Concentration is not stated as a percentage: pages label the perfumes only 'Perfume' (Papaia Ibisco's description calls it 'EDP Perfume', recorded as Eau de Parfum) and the others 'Luxury Cologne', so those labels are kept as written. The product page for Nero Divino is titled 'Black Divine Perfume' in English; the brand name Nero Divino used elsewhere on the site is kept. Note names were normalised to lowercase singular English and obvious spelling slips fixed (narcisus, tangerin, labdano, patchouly, frangipane). No perfumer, family, accords, release year or performance data is given on the pages, so those are null/empty. Country is taken from the site's FIRENZE branding; no distributors listed.",
